{"id":"vod_hh_55423","vodId":"55423","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"S·A特优生","name_cn":"S·A特优生","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/bca7d174d4387a5394a9c3d899091b2d.jpg"},"summary":"被热爱职业摔跤的父亲从小悉心培养长大的华园光（后藤邑子 配音）是个摔跤高手，她从没碰到过对手，直到泷岛彗（福山润 配音）的出现。为了打败彗，光说服父亲考进了白选馆学园高校，并进入了S•A班。所谓S•A班就是special A班，尖子班中的尖子班，只有全年级前七名的精英学生才能进入S•A班。但是光在这里依然打不败全年级第一的彗，还被彗戏谑地称作永远的第二名。除了彗和光，S•A班里还有第三名、第四名的天才音乐家的孩子山本纯（代永翼 配音）和山本芽（高垣彩阳 配音）双胞胎兄妹；第五名的学院理事长的儿子狩野宙（下野紘 配音）；第六名的航空公司社长千金东堂明（生天目仁美 配音）；第七名的体育用品公司社长的儿子辻龙（堀江一真 配音）。光一次次挑战彗的故事还在继续……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-08 09:42:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerpxE6b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb42ok6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZgBw6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwxDEwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepnvR6b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel0ov6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGAOY0a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aArGQzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQXpOYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVWxN1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0Mk2Xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXPzMme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejBmv5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7e5MplRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVWx51a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQXpNYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","